e8LcPbvGXrQQ7kNvwEFHqLa&_nc_oc=AdpOmZeUfIjKUSclaFMk79WK5t2MyFumkJcnqntCptnpuYzCRDAc_HGcAeLxAY31Hv8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afz8cqMIIOvRxChfxUL9SBbVSIz3eY9ksisa_qdZXSjicg&oe=69C933B7"}, {"file_name": "04.png", "id": "771918482106759", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619465_771918485440092_2131832106720639880_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kHfbUlecPEAQ7kNvwFndglm&_nc_oc=AdreG238Q1NwGGP2Upyd3zjNGlr4qAxnSG0-Ne8mQpl92chj-c6DxYiiayQhNUkaZik&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfwJ3Ppl4uVI8eZ0CISAjVgyBVE93owl3z558XziQLjoug&oe=69C9354A"}, {"file_name": "05.png", "id": "24094775356867679", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499298543_24094775363534345_8848995430294496546_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JVFfKYdF00EQ7kNvwEhqS2j&_nc_oc=Adp3-1xcDC5An61YHpivTsMpBpSgvg_qlPtQwBzewht0xc88D5UtY-5wXjmprETNts8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxgP06kDXmRBsJl-NreIc0yZPwFAiP_g6C1hsa6U1I5rQ&oe=69C9226F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "MOKNVG", "keywords": ["Nightvision", "NVG"], "long_description": "# Simulated Night Vision Experience\nThe MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience.\n\n**Features**\n- Customizable dummy NVG effect (with color adjustment)\n- Fully interactable NVG device functions\n- Supports both controller and hand interactions\n- Adjustable focus effect and DoF center mask for aiming with optics(Quest 3 only)\n\n**Interactable Controls**\n- Flip-down\n- Forward / Back adjustment\n- Side flip rotation\n- Left / Right switch\n- Pod power switch\n- Focus control\n- Manual gain control\n\n**Current available NVG type**\n- Monocular  NVG\n\n**Notice**\n- Current camera input has a 40\u201360 ms delay\n-  Input image is not fully accurate due to limitations in the API used during app development\n\n- Play safe and watch your surroundings!\n\n**Requred Device** \n- Quest 3 / Quest 3S\n- Must be running Horizon OS v74 or higher", "short_description": "MOKNVG simulates dummy night vision effect with realistic device operations, offering an immersive and interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Logo_01.png", "id": "24692493507105236", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825041_24692493510438569_5662868901094719245_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=woteR_ChgQsQ7kNvwHKXMxp&_nc_oc=AdoWDSM0G5F8zbzofS0-JyL-GAK7L76SddjWIlgxNWQCFpFk-JugxMV4xiEhLGW55QM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxB3GI23EDMQ5l6NFhuIUA-kBdOCkKpiZ_3cKWwAp0jiQ&oe=69C90BC3"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Landscape_2560x1440_01.png", "id": "1831122448283491", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618984_1831122454950157_3916287305954730484_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=q3F-iAFxeXIQ7kNvwGUs7-2&_nc_oc=AdrVKkE75-4uhjUVLNNOLaceKnjsmi5tuxg69cllnf6wQkhCT5C3X2pOo6ywtKqWQ2g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_AfxYt8UmXJiTNDDXMz4RfvAxdg20wPK9vvNWaopeFR3jDg&oe=69C90418"}, {"file_name": "Icon_512x512.png", "id": "1686371038722132", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831798_1686371042055465_2000336760327949752_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lHh68NGI9VAQ7kNvwFsUDPC&_nc_oc=Adp2zw5PuCNAye7PLYs_-iDyrppyBxV_PASuuG1QejDoTCZffienUV_1FydpKiBMsrg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Afy6AbHbARyKudeqUWXigobILpP8KGsCZS7Q1jcRaoyy0A&oe=69C9173C"}, {"file_name": "Cover_Square_1440x1440_01.png", "id": "1338680584514953", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619594_1338680587848286_62080